  "QuestionText": "What qualifications and experience does the new MD bring to the position?",
  "BroadTopic": "Appointment of Managing Director",
  "AnswerText": "<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n    <li style=\"color: black; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Simon Walker worked in a public policy role with the Western Australian government for 23 years.</span></p>\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"color: black; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Simon was the State&rsquo;s representative on the peak COAG Industry and Skills Council&rsquo;s advisory body, the Skills Senior Officials&rsquo; Network for 10 years.</span></p>\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"color: black; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Simon has been a Director of the Board of the NCVER for four years.</span></p>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Calibri;\">Simon&rsquo;s career has also included representation/membership on a range of National and State based bodies, including;</span></p>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n    <li style=\"color: black; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Australian Industry Skills Committee</span></p>\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"color: black; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size: 12pt;